  "status": "Refused",
  "actual_commencement_date": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed first-floor external amenity spaces, by virtue of their enclosed nature, would create a form of development whereby occupiers of habitable rooms and users of the amenity spaces would be provided with poor outlook opportunities. This would be to the detriment of continued enjoyment of the dwelling and is contrary to the amenity objectives of Policy 57 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024), which seek to provide future occupiers with high-quality living conditions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;In the absence of a legal agreement to restrict future occupiers in obtaining on-street parking permits, the proposal fails to secure a sustainable form of development and is therefore contrary to Policy 66 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024), which seeks to promote sustainable methods of transport and reduce the levels of parking stress in residential areas.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed outrigger design, by virtue of its flat-roof design and materiality, presents an out of character addition that is of poor visual amenity value when viewed with the building as a whole. This is considered harmful to the character and appearance of both the host building and wider conservation area and therefore fails to comply with the design objectives of Policies 53 and 72 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024), which seek to ensure that development responds appropriate to the character of the locality.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;In the absence of a legal agreement to secure necessary financial contributions, the proposed development fails to secure adequate mitigation against harm to the SAC and therefore fails to comply with Policy 81 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024) and the Supplementary Planning Document - Planning Obligations (2017).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
